---
---
<dialog class="errata" data-errata aria-labelledby="errata-title">
  <div class="errata__inner">
    <header class="errata__head">
      <p class="label">Loose sheet, inserted after the colophon</p>
      <h2 id="errata-title" class="errata__title">Errata <em>&amp; directions for use</em></h2>
    </header>

    <dl class="errata__keys">
      <div><dt><kbd>g</kbd> <kbd>i</kbd></dt><dd>Go to the index</dd></div>
      <div><dt><kbd>g</kbd> <kbd>w</kbd></dt><dd>Go to the plates</dd></div>
      <div><dt><kbd>g</kbd> <kbd>p</kbd></dt><dd>Go to the field log</dd></div>
      <div><dt><kbd>g</kbd> <kbd>a</kbd></dt><dd>Go to about</dd></div>
      <div><dt><kbd>g</kbd> <kbd>o</kbd></dt><dd>Go to now</dd></div>
      <div><dt><kbd>g</kbd> <kbd>n</kbd></dt><dd>Go to notes</dd></div>
      <div><dt><kbd>t</kbd></dt><dd>Paper / darkroom</dd></div>
      <div><dt><kbd>[</kbd> <kbd>]</kbd></dt><dd>Previous / next plate</dd></div>
      <div><dt><kbd>?</kbd></dt><dd>This sheet</dd></div>
    </dl>

    <ol class="errata__list">
      <li><span class="mono">p. 001</span> For “models he has taken apart”, read “models that took him apart, a little, each time”.</li>
      <li><span class="mono">Pl. III</span> Some rejected digits were, on reflection, perfectly good digits.</li>
      <li><span class="mono">passim</span> <span>The atlas lists seven plates. Its binder counted eight. <a href="/plate-0/" class="errata__secret">See the missing one&nbsp;→</a></span></li>
    </ol>

    <label class="errata__switch mono">
      <input type="checkbox" data-keys-toggle checked />
      <span>Single-key shortcuts on (turn off if you use speech input)</span>
    </label>

    <form method="dialog" class="errata__foot">
      <button class="label" type="submit" autofocus>Close <kbd>Esc</kbd></button>
    </form>
  </div>
</dialog>
